# Conventions

Follow @.context/conventions.md.

- Package manager is `pnpm` only. Do not use npm or yarn.
- Scripts: `pnpm dev`, `pnpm build` (`tsc -b` then Vite), `pnpm preview`.
- TypeScript is strict; keep components small and typed.
- Conventional commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `refactor:`, `style:`) when the user asks to commit.
- Never auto-commit.
